Begin3
Title:          which
Version:        2.1a
Entered-Date:   2002-03-20
Description:    Find executables located in the PATH directory list
Keywords:       DOS, extension, file, utility, find, locate, PATH
Author:         trane@tranefrancks.com (Trane Francks)
Maintained-By:  trane@tranefrancks.com (Trane Francks)
Primary-Site:   https://tranefrancks.com/Tranes_World__Reinvented/Programming.html
Original-Site:  http://www2.gol.com/users/trane/programming/programming.html
Platforms:      DOS, Compiler: Borland Turbo Pascal 7.0
Copying-Policy: GNU General Public License, Version 2
Summary:        Enables users to find executable files in directories listed in
                the PATH environment variable. Full wildcard support, relative
                pathnames, optional file details (size, date). User-definable
                program extensions, codepage-correct time/date formatting. New
                DOS switchar support.
Modified-Date:  2025-04-10.1
Changes:        * NLS: English typo corrections and Swedish translation
                update|* Metadata update for modified-time and LFN
                requirements|* improved repository INDEX.md
